  "description": "Shin Jia steps into the clinic for a routine checkup, only to find herself trapped in a world of pure indulgence. Under the quiet dim of the examination room, medical procedure turns into an irresistible game of temptation. Surrounded by striking physicians who refuse to keep their hands to themselves, Jia burns with shame as their gloved touches explore her most sensitive spots. Leading the pack is Dr. Doh Minjun, whose cool professionalism hides a devious urge to push her boundaries. What was meant to be a simple exam quickly devolves into a seductive ordeal she cannot resist.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
